{"id":"four-sources","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"concept-four-context-sources","question":"Agent 上下文由哪四类来源组成？","aliases":["聊天记录摘要记忆知识怎么区分"],"keywords":["Agent上下文","四类来源","聊天记录","摘要","记忆","知识"],"diagnostic":"检查消息、摘要、用户事实和知识。","hints":["查看 #concept-four-context-sources。","生命周期不同。"],"example":"window/summary/memory/knowledge。","answer":"最近消息窗口、结构化会话摘要、长期用户记忆和带来源的知识检索。","source":{"label":"四类上下文","href":"#concept-four-context-sources"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"separate-sources","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"concept-four-context-sources","question":"为什么四类上下文不能合成一个字符串？","aliases":["上下文来源分开有什么用"],"keywords":["上下文","合成字符串","来源分开"],"diagnostic":"检查删除、过期、授权和评估需求。","hints":["查看 #concept-four-context-sources。","治理规则不同。"],"example":"memory有TTL，knowledge有version。","answer":"它们的来源、生命周期、授权、删除和评估规则不同，合并后无法独立治理。","source":{"label":"四类上下文","href":"#concept-four-context-sources"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"memory-eligibility","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"concept-memory-governance","question":"长期记忆进入上下文前检查什么？","aliases":["什么记忆才可以召回"],"keywords":["长期记忆","上下文","召回","检查"],"diagnostic":"检查主体、同意和TTL。","hints":["查看 #concept-memory-governance。","三项必须同时满足。"],"example":"owner+consent+expires_at。","answer":"主体必须匹配、用户已同意且TTL未过期，随后还要通过上下文预算。","source":{"label":"记忆治理","href":"#concept-memory-governance"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"memory-injection","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"concept-memory-governance","question":"记忆里写了忽略规则时怎样处理？","aliases":["历史内容能覆盖系统Prompt吗"],"keywords":["记忆","忽略规则","历史内容","系统Prompt"],"diagnostic":"检查数据与指令边界。","hints":["查看 #concept-memory-governance。","instruction=false。"],"example":"USER_FACT数据块。","answer":"把它作为带来源的用户事实数据并标记instruction=false，不能提升为系统指令。","source":{"label":"记忆治理","href":"#concept-memory-governance"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"structured-summary","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"concept-four-context-sources","question":"结构化摘要应该保存哪些内容？","aliases":["会话摘要要保存思维链吗"],"keywords":["结构化摘要","会话摘要","思维链"],"diagnostic":"检查目标、决定和未决问题。","hints":["查看 #concept-four-context-sources。","不保存隐式推理。"],"example":"goal/decisions/open_questions。","answer":"保存目标、已确认决定、未决问题和来源消息计数，不保存隐式思维链。","source":{"label":"四类上下文","href":"#concept-four-context-sources"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"budget-assembly","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"example-budgeted-context-package","question":"上下文预算应何时执行？","aliases":["最后截断上下文可以吗"],"keywords":["上下文预算","执行","截断"],"diagnostic":"检查是否逐项计算并记录淘汰。","hints":["查看 #example-budgeted-context-package。","装入前检查。"],"example":"used+cost<=budget。","answer":"在每项装入前硬执行，放不下就记录类型和原因；不能最后盲目截断。","source":{"label":"预算上下文包","href":"#example-budgeted-context-package"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"window-order","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"example-budgeted-context-package","question":"消息窗口为什么从新到旧选择？","aliases":["对话太长时保留哪些消息"],"keywords":["消息窗口","新到旧","对话太长"],"diagnostic":"检查局部连贯和摘要兜底。","hints":["查看 #example-budgeted-context-package。","旧信息进入摘要。"],"example":"recent messages first。","answer":"最近消息最能维持局部对话；更早信息由结构化摘要承接。","source":{"label":"预算上下文包","href":"#example-budgeted-context-package"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"forget-memory","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"modify-add-memory-delete","question":"用户忘记记忆后怎样验证已生效？","aliases":["删除长期记忆要测什么"],"keywords":["忘记记忆","验证","删除长期记忆"],"diagnostic":"检查下一次装配和跨主体删除。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-memory-delete。","删除后立即不召回。"],"example":"memory ID不再出现。","answer":"下一次装配不得再出现该memory ID，并测试owner校验、404和重复删除幂等。","source":{"label":"查看并忘记","href":"#modify-add-memory-delete"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
