{"id":"memory-eval","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-02","context_id":"deepen-memory-evaluation","question":"记忆质量为什么不能只看召回率？","aliases":["Agent记得越多越好吗"],"keywords":["记忆质量","召回率","Agent"],"diagnostic":"检查错误主体、过期和注入误用。","hints":["查看 #deepen-memory-evaluation。","误用比漏用危险。"],"example":"cross-owner misuse。","answer":"还要测错误主体召回、过期误用和注入服从；记得越多不代表越安全。","source":{"label":"记忆质量评估","href":"#deepen-memory-evaluation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
